/// The attenuation of a part's volume (MIDI controller 7), in
/// [`LOG_ONE`] units: entry `v` is `round(2 × log2(127 / v) × 1024)`, and
/// entry 0 is 16384, at which the kernel is silent.
///
/// Source: own choice. Amplitude follows the square of the controller
/// value, the usual law for a volume controller, and it is applied as a
/// logarithm so that the kernel needs no multiplication for it.
#[rustfmt::skip]
